{"ID":"20240513083311-kw07hsh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083311-kw07hsh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083311-kw07hsh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114827-sdmcopq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114827-sdmcopq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114827-sdmcopq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:356,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:356\u0026#125;","title":"099","type":"doc","updated":"20240513114827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513114827-sdmcopq","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 817px;","id":"20240513114827-sdmcopq","updated":"20240513114827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"080-1 L, R"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/3/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"慢性盲腸炎有十五年了,她體內宿便清的差不多了但袋口收不起來。此人之前服了很多劑的大黃牡丹皮湯跟薏苡附子敗醬散。今日來診訴有三天沒大便，心悸，前額頭痛兩天。右下腹仍有時會痛，有時幾乎無痛了。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"知道她三天沒大便要考慮是否為承氣湯證且要分辨是哪種承氣湯證，因此要問小便顏色來判斷寒熱，患者答：小便深黃；故知為熱證，承氣湯證。再問有無排氣來判斷要用大或小承氣湯，患者答：無排氣；故知用大承氣湯。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃亁。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診：\n3、面部：\n4、身體："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 燥熱仍有,有時子宮痛(瘀血)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃牡丹皮湯1+薏苡附子敗醬散1+再加大黃1+芒硝1+黨參1+茜草1+莪朮1+三稜1 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200Caps"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔黃為熱,舌苔亁為燥。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}